3$ and ${x}_{m}=8$ are the endpoints of our partition, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}({x}_{i}+{x}_{i-1})Δ{x}_{i} & ={x}_{m}^{2}-{x}_{0}^{2} \\\\  & ={8}^{2}-{3}^{2} \\\\  & =55.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-c921d9f4-e9e5-5990-b776-9a71c2e5fae5"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-c921d9f4-e9e5-5990-b776-9a71c2e5fae5" :answer-field/id #uuid "c921d9f4-e9e5-5990-b776-9a71c2e5fae5" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-71078581-d224-590e-aece-ba642e26197c" :answer-field/choices ["answer-c26c4349-ac20-5ab9-8ce1-f10f9aa95ddf" "answer-3fc3b644-19ca-548e-b453-703cf5bf0c4e" "answer-1cf29ab3-9af5-5796-9465-f813a4142e49" "answer-71078581-d224-590e-aece-ba642e26197c" "answer-6eb0f8f3-cceb-58b9-8f07-6881841fbb1c"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c26c4349-ac20-5ab9-8ce1-f10f9aa95ddf" :answer/id #uuid "c26c4349-ac20-5ab9-8ce1-f10f9aa95ddf" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "50" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-3fc3b644-19ca-548e-b453-703cf5bf0c4e" :answer/id #uuid "3fc3b644-19ca-548e-b453-703cf5bf0c4e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "52" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-1cf29ab3-9af5-5796-9465-f813a4142e49" :answer/id #uuid "1cf29ab3-9af5-5796-9465-f813a4142e49" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "54" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-71078581-d224-590e-aece-ba642e26197c" :answer/id #uuid "71078581-d224-590e-aece-ba642e26197c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "55" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-6eb0f8f3-cceb-58b9-8f07-6881841fbb1c" :answer/id #uuid "6eb0f8f3-cceb-58b9-8f07-6881841fbb1c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "56" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} [:db/retract 17592186189532 :answer-field/choices 17592186189536] [:db/retract 17592186189532 :answer-field/choices 17592186189537] [:db/retract 17592186189532 :answer-field/choices 17592186189533] [:db/retract 17592186189532 :answer-field/choices 17592186189534] [:db/retract 17592186189532 :answer-field/choices 17592186189535] {:db/id 17592186192941 :question/problem "Solve the inequality $\\frac{7-3x}{2}>2.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we clear the rational expression by multiplying both sides by $2:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{7-3x}{2} & >2 \\\\ 2\\cdot (\\frac{7-3x}{2}) & >2\\cdot 2 \\\\ \\cancel{2}\\cdot (\\frac{7-3x}{\\cancel{2}}) & >2\\cdot 2 \\\\ 7-3x & >4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we apply the addition and multiplication principles. \n\nRemember, when we divide an inequality by a negative number, we need to flip the inequality sign:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}7-3x & >4 \\\\ 7-3x-7 & >4-7 \\\\ -3x & >-3 \\\\ \\frac{-3x}{-3} & \\,\\,<\\,\\,\\frac{-3}{-3} \\\\ x & <1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is $x<1.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186189532 :answer-field/correct "answer-03dd1bfc-524a-526c-ab47-ea2176047136" :answer-field/choices ["answer-a27ca631-3d74-5d12-a5b9-dd9f1c08420e" "answer-03dd1bfc-524a-526c-ab47-ea2176047136" "answer-47aa3e32-e1b5-524e-93ad-e8eb5b6262a6" "answer-ee93ae1d-35f0-50c0-842b-0fc48ec6a8af" "answer-b8429d24-fcb3-5137-8d24-cdf2001e2ab4"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-a27ca631-3d74-5d12-a5b9-dd9f1c08420e" :answer/id #uuid "a27ca631-3d74-5d12-a5b9-dd9f1c08420e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x<-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-03dd1bfc-524a-526c-ab47-ea2176047136" :answer/id #uuid "03dd1bfc-524a-526c-ab47-ea2176047136" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x<1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-47aa3e32-e1b5-524e-93ad-e8eb5b6262a6" :answer/id #uuid "47aa3e32-e1b5-524e-93ad-e8eb5b6262a6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x>-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-ee93ae1d-35f0-50c0-842b-0fc48ec6a8af" :answer/id #uuid "ee93ae1d-35f0-50c0-842b-0fc48ec6a8af" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x>1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-b8429d24-fcb3-5137-8d24-cdf2001e2ab4" :answer/id #uuid "b8429d24-fcb3-5137-8d24-cdf2001e2ab4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x>3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186192823 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-4a18f4a9-430a-58c6-95f9-9ffd1a99116a" "question-a275c58b-24cd-59ec-af04-d47c2cd4c395"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-4a18f4a9-430a-58c6-95f9-9ffd1a99116a" :question/id #uuid "4a18f4a9-430a-58c6-95f9-9ffd1a99116a" :question/math-academy-id "q-154925" :question/problem "Solve the inequality $3a-7>\\frac{8a+5}{4}.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we clear the rational expression by multiplying both sides by $4:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3a-7 & >\\frac{8a+5}{4} \\\\ 4\\cdot (3a-7) & >4\\cdot (\\frac{8a+5}{4}) \\\\ 4\\cdot (3a-7) & >\\cancel{4}\\cdot (\\frac{8a+5}{\\cancel{4}}) \\\\ 4\\cdot (3a-7) & >8a+5 \\\\ 12a-28 & >8a+5\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we apply the addition and multiplication principles:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}12a-28 & >8a+5 \\\\ 12a-28-8a & >8a+5-8a \\\\ 4a-28 & >5 \\\\ 4a-28+28 & >5+28 \\\\ 4a & >33 \\\\ \\frac{4a}{4} & >\\frac{33}{4} \\\\ a & >\\frac{33}{4}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is $a>\\frac{33}{4}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-6cd1d0a2-4c61-5c3b-bb28-d1ae4bccad5c"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-6cd1d0a2-4c61-5c3b-bb28-d1ae4bccad5c" :answer-field/id #uuid "6cd1d0a2-4c61-5c3b-bb28-d1ae4bccad5c" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-57dc35d6-a280-5f88-b102-c62b5b783067" :answer-field/choices ["answer-ad14d68e-ca86-505f-bc2e-62689bb72b3f" "answer-31acdef2-9f74-5071-a506-a89cb8de8967" "answer-ba9847dc-820c-5f4c-ac3e-314918c2a2b3" "answer-dcee4a9e-e91f-5041-879e-d70732fa07ec" "answer-57dc35d6-a280-5f88-b102-c62b5b783067"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-ad14d68e-ca86-505f-bc2e-62689bb72b3f" :answer/id #uuid "ad14d68e-ca86-505f-bc2e-62689bb72b3f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "a<-\\frac{33}{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-31acdef2-9f74-5071-a506-a89cb8de8967" :answer/id #uuid "31acdef2-9f74-5071-a506-a89cb8de8967" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "a<\\frac{33}{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-ba9847dc-820c-5f4c-ac3e-314918c2a2b3" :answer/id #uuid "ba9847dc-820c-5f4c-ac3e-314918c2a2b3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "a>-\\frac{33}{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-dcee4a9e-e91f-5041-879e-d70732fa07ec" :answer/id #uuid "dcee4a9e-e91f-5041-879e-d70732fa07ec" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "a>\\frac{33}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-57dc35d6-a280-5f88-b102-c62b5b783067" :answer/id #uuid "57dc35d6-a280-5f88-b102-c62b5b783067" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "a>\\frac{33}{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186192824 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-dc1245c0-95c3-5566-8f75-3345f8116530" "question-5cd68e49-7c20-564f-9257-0043b16b7cd5"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-dc1245c0-95c3-5566-8f75-3345f8116530" :question/id #uuid "dc1245c0-95c3-5566-8f75-3345f8116530" :question/math-academy-id "q-156054" :question/problem "Solve the inequality $\\frac{3z+1}{2}>\\frac{-28+6z}{7}.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we clear the rational expressions by multiplying both sides of the inequality by the lowest common positive multiple of the denominators:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{3z+1}{2} & >\\frac{-28+6z}{7} \\\\ 14\\cdot (\\frac{3z+1}{2}) & >14\\cdot (\\frac{-28+6z}{7}) \\\\ 7\\cdot (3z+1) & >2\\cdot (-28+6z) \\\\ 21z+7 & >-56+12z\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we apply the addition and multiplication principles:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}21z+7 & >-56+12z \\\\ 21z+7-12z & >-56+12z-12z \\\\ 9z+7 & >-56 \\\\ 9z+7-7 & >-56-7 \\\\ 9z & >-63 \\\\ \\frac{9z}{9} & >\\frac{-63}{9} \\\\ z & >-7\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is $z>-7.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-eb1ad4f1-13a1-54ac-b3a4-af4682c466cc"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-eb1ad4f1-13a1-54ac-b3a4-af4682c466cc" :answer-field/id #uuid "eb1ad4f1-13a1-54ac-b3a4-af4682c466cc" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-3519c2e5-5f0c-5be4-91e1-e42db2f66c0b" :answer-field/choices ["answer-e606c3e3-7dab-5779-990d-e0e59050c9ea" "answer-9926e2fb-fd74-51d3-bba5-349637b1d762" "answer-ee0b25a1-2583-58a7-a151-48ea5344260a" "answer-4bb378fe-4f71-5580-ab7e-5f601b873bc5" "answer-3519c2e5-5f0c-5be4-91e1-e42db2f66c0b"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e606c3e3-7dab-5779-990d-e0e59050c9ea" :answer/id #uuid "e606c3e3-7dab-5779-990d-e0e59050c9ea" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "z<-5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-9926e2fb-fd74-51d3-bba5-349637b1d762" :answer/id #uuid "9926e2fb-fd74-51d3-bba5-349637b1d762" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "z<5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-ee0b25a1-2583-58a7-a151-48ea5344260a" :answer/id #uuid "ee0b25a1-2583-58a7-a151-48ea5344260a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "z<7" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-4bb378fe-4f71-5580-ab7e-5f601b873bc5" :answer/id #uuid "4bb378fe-4f71-5580-ab7e-5f601b873bc5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "z>-5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-3519c2e5-5f0c-5be4-91e1-e42db2f66c0b" :answer/id #uuid "3519c2e5-5f0c-5be4-91e1-e42db2f66c0b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "z>-7" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-a275c58b-24cd-59ec-af04-d47c2cd4c395" :question/id #uuid "a275c58b-24cd-59ec-af04-d47c2cd4c395" :question/math-academy-id "q-181376" :question/problem "Find the solution to the inequality $\\frac{3-5z}{8}\\le 6-2z.$\n\nThe solution is $z$\n{{field-1}}{{field-2}}." :question/worked-solution "First, we clear the rational expression by multiplying both sides by $8:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{3-5z}{8} & \\le 6-2z \\\\ 8\\cdot (\\frac{3-5z}{8}) & \\le 8\\cdot (6-2z) \\\\ \\cancel{8}\\cdot (\\frac{3-5z}{\\cancel{8}}) & \\le 8\\cdot (6-2z) \\\\ 3-5z & \\le 48-16z\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we apply the addition and multiplication principles:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3-5z & \\le 48-16z \\\\ 3-5z+16z & \\le 48-16z+16z \\\\ 3+11z & \\le 48 \\\\ 3+11z-3 & \\le 48-3 \\\\ 11z & \\le 45 \\\\ \\frac{11z}{11} & \\le \\frac{45}{11} \\\\ z & \\le \\frac{45}{11}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is $z\\le \\frac{45}{11}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-592b7cac-318f-5d38-9731-e0a49d20cd01" "answer-field-0556b669-b38b-5beb-96f6-08e8bd808d5b"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-592b7cac-318f-5d38-9731-e0a49d20cd01" :answer-field/id #uuid "592b7cac-318f-5d38-9731-e0a49d20cd01" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-b40dda2b-d093-582e-8a93-141dcd009b0e" :answer-field/choices ["answer-b40dda2b-d093-582e-8a93-141dcd009b0e"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-b40dda2b-d093-582e-8a93-141dcd009b0e" :answer/id #uuid "b40dda2b-d093-582e-8a93-141dcd009b0e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\le" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-0556b669-b38b-5beb-96f6-08e8bd808d5b" :answer-field/id #uuid "0556b669-b38b-5beb-96f6-08e8bd808d5b" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-7c20ac5a-f811-58a6-b83e-5889a9700680" :answer-field/choices ["answer-7c20ac5a-f811-58a6-b83e-5889a9700680"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-7c20ac5a-f811-58a6-b83e-5889a9700680" :answer/id #uuid "7c20ac5a-f811-58a6-b83e-5889a9700680" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{45}{11}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-5cd68e49-7c20-564f-9257-0043b16b7cd5" :question/id #uuid "5cd68e49-7c20-564f-9257-0043b16b7cd5" :question/math-academy-id "q-181417" :question/problem "Find the solution to the inequality $\\frac{x+6}{4}>\\frac{2x}{3}.$\n\nThe solution is $x$\n{{field-1}}{{field-2}}." :question/worked-solution "First, we clear the rational expressions by multiplying both sides of the inequality by the lowest common positive multiple of the denominators:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{x+6}{4} & >\\frac{2x}{3} \\\\ 12\\cdot (\\frac{x+6}{4}) & >12\\cdot (\\frac{2x}{3}) \\\\ 3\\cdot (x+6) & >4\\cdot 2x \\\\ 3x+18 & >8x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we apply the addition and multiplication principles. \n\nRemember, when we divide an inequality by a negative number, we need to flip the inequality sign:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3x+18 & >8x \\\\ 3x+18-8x & >8x-8x \\\\ 18-5x & >0 \\\\ 18-5x-18 & >0-18 \\\\ -5x & >-18 \\\\ \\frac{-5x}{-5} & \\,\\,<\\,\\,\\frac{-18}{-5} \\\\ x & <\\frac{18}{5}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is $x<\\frac{18}{5}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-617e3c87-3819-5e4d-88da-1609df57e47e" "answer-field-dd9b0211-f69a-526f-b18b-0a11d5fc2f14"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-617e3c87-3819-5e4d-88da-1609df57e47e" :answer-field/id #uuid "617e3c87-3819-5e4d-88da-1609df57e47e" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-9b16f81c-e174-5d24-b5c3-e147e2a28ebb" :answer-field/choices ["answer-9b16f81c-e174-5d24-b5c3-e147e2a28ebb"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-9b16f81c-e174-5d24-b5c3-e147e2a28ebb" :answer/id #uuid "9b16f81c-e174-5d24-b5c3-e147e2a28ebb" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "<"